#!args --verify-dirty --autosave-dir build/jfn_autosave
# a second crash after Wiederherstellen loses nothing (doc/autosave.rs): autosave_recover.uis
# (run just before) recovered the copy and ended before it kept one of its own; its session
# held the recovered copy until then, so it is offered again.  Wiederherstellen, then Beenden
# with Verwerfen: the changes go and the copies with them, so the next start offers nothing
# (the selftest's group ui checks the files).  The shot keeps the folder of the copies (see
# autosave.uis).
shot build/jfn_autosave/reopen.png
theme light
expect "Ungespeicherte Änderungen an „two_pcs.jfnet“ gefunden" exists
click button:"Wiederherstellen"
expect "Ungespeicherte Änderungen an „two_pcs.jfnet“ gefunden" missing
expect "„two_pcs.jfnet“ wiederhergestellt" exists
expect text:"2 Geräte · 1 Kabel" exists
expect listitem:"PC2" missing
# Beenden with the changes unsaved: the question; Verwerfen drops them and the copies
key ctrl+q
expect dialog:"Änderungen speichern?" exists
click button:"Verwerfen"
expect dialog:"Änderungen speichern?" missing
expect_nowarn
